    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Everyone's Valley is the product of discussions between hundreds of community members concerned about housing and inclusiveness. The report details the extent of the housing crisis in the region and proposes a bold new plan to create 8,600 new units of affordable housing in San Jose and Santa Clara.",
